{"product":{"id":8167652851966,"title":"RAW NUTRITION CBUM Itholate Protein","body_html":"\u003ch2 class=\"text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.375rem] font-bold\"\u003eRAW Nutrition CBUM Itholate Protein\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eA premium \u003cstrong\u003ewhey isolate protein\u003c\/strong\u003e built and personally formulated by 5x Mr. Olympia Classic Physique champion Chris Bumstead — designed for serious lifters, physique athletes, lactose-sensitive trainers, and active adults who want maximum protein per scoop with the cleanest possible macro profile and the easiest digestion. Particularly suited to those running cuts, anyone who gets bloated or has stomach discomfort from concentrate-heavy whey, lifters running competition prep, and athletes wanting an athlete-led brand pedigree behind their daily isolate.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eWhat separates CBUM Itholate from the standard whey isolate on the market comes down to filtration depth and digestibility engineering. The product uses a cutting-edge cold micro-filtration process that strips out excess fats and the majority of the lactose while preserving the protein structure intact — delivering 25g of high-quality whey isolate protein per scoop with a fat-free formulation and minimal carbs. Each serving packs the full essential amino acid profile to support muscle protein synthesis, recovery, and lean tissue repair. The reduced lactose content is what makes this product genuinely different from concentrate-based whey: significantly easier on the stomach for those with mild lactose sensitivity, no bloating, no GI discomfort. Personally formulated by Chris Bumstead — meaningful credibility from one of the top physique athletes in the world. Available in flavour collaborations with major IP partners (the CBUM Series is known for ambitious flavour engineering), solving the chalky-flavour problem that plagues most isolate proteins.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eRAW Nutrition manufactures CBUM Itholate Protein in the United States in facilities certified to \u003ca class=\"underline underline underline-offset-2 decoration-1 decoration-current\/40 hover:decoration-current focus:decoration-current\" href=\"https:\/\/www.who.int\/health-topics\/good-manufacturing-practices\"\u003eGMP\u003c\/a\u003e standards, with rigorous quality control across the range. Note: this specific product is not Informed-Sport certified — competing tested-pool athletes should always check the most current ingredient panel against their governing body's banned-substance list before use; for everyone else, RAW's manufacturing pedigree, athlete-led product development, and full label transparency make it one of the more credible options in the \u003cstrong\u003ewhey isolate protein\u003c\/strong\u003e category.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul class=\"[li_\u0026amp;]:mb-0 [li_\u0026amp;]:mt-1 [li_\u0026amp;]:gap-1 [\u0026amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [\u0026amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3\"\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e25g of high-quality whey isolate protein per scoop\u003c\/strong\u003e — clean macros for daily training and recovery, with the full essential amino acid profile\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCold micro-filtration process\u003c\/strong\u003e removes excess fats and most of the lactose — significantly easier on the stomach than concentrate-based whey\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eFat-free formulation with minimal carbs\u003c\/strong\u003e — strong cutting-phase profile, ideal for competition prep\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePersonally formulated by Chris Bumstead\u003c\/strong\u003e — athlete-led credibility from a 5x Mr. Olympia Classic Physique champion\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eStrong value at the whey protein isolate price in Sri Lanka category\u003c\/strong\u003e — premium athlete-led brand, easier alternative to \u003cstrong\u003ewhey protein hydrolyzed\u003c\/strong\u003e for daily use\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003ePair it with a daily multivitamin or recovery supplement from our \u003ca class=\"underline underline underline-offset-2 decoration-1 decoration-current\/40 hover:decoration-current focus:decoration-current\" href=\"\/collections\/vitamins-supplements\"\u003evitamins and supplements range\u003c\/a\u003e to round out a complete training stack.\u003c\/p\u003e","vendor":"RAW","product_type":"WHEY PROTEIN","created_at":"2023-11-03T00:57:56+05:30","handle":"raw-cbum-itholate-protein","updated_at":"2026-10-18T01:25:49+05:30","published_at":"2025-04-03T00:01:14+05:30","template_suffix":"raw-nutrition","published_scope":"global","tags":"ISOLATE PROTEIN","variants":[{"id":47179572347134,"product_id":8167652851966,"title":"25 Servings \/ Milk \u0026 Cookies","price":"24999.00","sku":null,"position":1,"compare_at_price":"","fulfillment_service":"manual","inventory_management":"shopify","option1":"25 Servings","option2":"Milk \u0026 Cookies","option3":null,"created_at":"2025-08-14T11:05:16+05:30","updated_at":"2026-10-18T01:25:49+05:30","taxable":true,"barcode":"68718334","grams":0,"image_id":47492720820478,"weight":0.0,"weight_unit":"kg","requires_shipping":true,"quantity_rule":{"min":1,"max":null,"increment":1},"price_currency":"LKR","compare_at_price_currency":"","quantity_price_breaks":[]},{"id":44369868718334,"product_id":8167652851966,"title":"25 Serving